sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Node A
    participant B as Node B
    participant ZK as Quorum store
    participant Res as Shared resource
    A->>ZK: create an ephemeral leader node
    ZK-->>A: you are the leader, fencing token 7
    B->>ZK: attempt the same
    ZK-->>B: taken — watch for changes
    A->>Res: write with token 7
    Note over A: A now pauses — GC, or a network partition
    ZK->>ZK: A's session expires
    ZK-->>B: you are the leader, fencing token 8
    B->>Res: write with token 8
    A->>Res: resumes, writes with token 7
    Res-->>A: rejected — 7 is older than 8
    Note over Res: the fencing token is what makes this safe — a lock alone is not
